# kin/child/hair/cropped: Cropped: close on the sides and the back, a short brushed top, the brow clear
# (KIN-CHILD, P2b wave 2; the child's 11 px head, STYLE_P2 3 and 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
